WEBVTT

00:01:58.196 --> 00:02:02.236
In exchange, judges agree
to be ultrarestrained,

00:02:02.276 --> 00:02:05.036
both in and out of court.

00:02:05.596 --> 00:02:09.236
A kind of veil comes down
when a judge is appointed.

00:02:09.836 --> 00:02:12.156
It's a lonely way to live,

00:02:12.196 --> 00:02:16.276
and it feeds into this sense
that judges are somehow different

00:02:16.276 --> 00:02:17.796
from the rest of us.

00:02:18.796 --> 00:02:24.396
Finally, I can tell you that all judges
are in theory appointed on merit.

00:02:24.996 --> 00:02:26.196
That sounds good.

00:02:26.236 --> 00:02:28.436
And in theory it is.

00:02:29.076 --> 00:02:32.076
Judges are chosen
in a confidential process